== PreToolUse: a write of code by the main conversation during an iteration
{"hookSpecificOutput":{"hookEventName":"PreToolUse","permissionDecision":"deny","permissionDecisionReason":"neither the main conversation nor an agent outside the loop writes code or tests during an iteration; the gates exist so that each is done by an agent that cannot see the others' reasoning. Instead: delegate the story's work to the agent whose gate it is. A file that is not the story's work, such as a note for the person or a commit message, goes under .sdlc/stories/A-1/ in the checkout this session works in (the story's worktree where it has one, not the main checkout), where the file tools may write it. Keep it out of the commit and remove it before the commit gate is recorded: where the project does not ignore that directory, a file left there is committed with the story. If neither fits, say what the work is and stop [orchestrator-delegates]"}}
