== Stop: the session working the story stops for the first time
{"continue":true,"decision":"block","reason":"A-1 is still being worked on. Work analysis and record it, or hand the story to a person with `sdlc escalate \u003ctype\u003e --message \"...\"` if it needs one. If the /sdlc:next runbook in this conversation no longer ends with \"Rework, at any gate\", compaction cut it short: do not work from memory, tell the person to type /sdlc:next to pick the story up where it is, and stop. A story left mid-gate is one nobody is looking at, so after 3 stops in a row with nothing recorded the loop hands it to a person itself (this was 1)."}
